WEBVTT

00:07.480 --> 00:10.490
It sucks that Rin-chan's off from school.

00:10.870 --> 00:13.250
I tried texting her a few minutes ago...

00:14.490 --> 00:16.950
Oh, it's from Rin-chan!

00:16.950 --> 00:18.740
Can I see that?

00:18.740 --> 00:20.120
H-Hey, virgin!

00:20.110 --> 00:22.140
RIN-CHAN

00:20.110 --> 00:22.140
A

00:20.110 --> 00:22.140
SWOLLEN FROM THE MU-

00:20.110 --> 00:22.140
I'M ALL SWOLLEN FROM THE MUMPS
DON'T WANT TO INFECT ANYONE
SO NO VISITS, YOUR WELL WISHES
WILL BE OKAY

00:20.820 --> 00:22.120
Aoki-sensei?

00:22.450 --> 00:24.750
Gawd, what are you doing?!

00:26.100 --> 00:27.040
Oh...

00:27.040 --> 00:28.340
S-Sorry.

00:30.330 --> 00:32.590
Hokay! Class has started!

00:33.230 --> 00:35.590
Today we'll start from page 107.

00:35.890 --> 00:38.710
Sensei, that's for language arts!

00:42.990 --> 00:45.970
Don't you think he's acting bizarre?

00:45.970 --> 00:48.980
He must be feeling lonely without Rin-chan.

00:49.830 --> 00:53.350
That lolicon actually has his sights on Rin-chan?

00:53.350 --> 00:55.110
Ew! Ew! Ewww!

00:55.110 --> 00:56.940
Panting like some mutt over a little girl,

00:56.940 --> 00:57.910
that sexual pervert!

00:57.910 --> 00:58.980
Hold on!

00:58.980 --> 01:02.870
Let's see... "panting like some mutt... over a little girl..."

01:03.250 --> 01:07.710
Kuro-chan, you're great at saying stuff that pleases Sensei.

01:08.390 --> 01:11.650
But, I'm not very good at that.

01:11.650 --> 01:14.570
So I need to learn how.

01:15.830 --> 01:19.680
You still think... Aoki is a masochist?

01:19.980 --> 01:20.420
Huh?

01:21.230 --> 01:24.680
Oh, it's fine. Very interesting, in fact.

01:25.980 --> 01:27.060
Hmm?

01:29.650 --> 01:31.570
Can't reach her?

01:32.110 --> 01:35.420
Yeah, and I can't get her voicemail either.

01:35.420 --> 01:36.570
Here you go.

01:37.790 --> 01:39.750
I apologize.

01:39.750 --> 01:43.130
Because of me, you all had to go through all that.

01:44.030 --> 01:48.730
When it comes to children, it is not rare to see parents overreact.

01:49.990 --> 01:55.590
It happens all the time. They'll cool down if you give them time.

01:56.230 --> 01:58.190
Right now, just watch and wait.

02:07.780 --> 02:08.980
This text...

02:08.980 --> 02:11.730
NEW EMAIL

02:08.980 --> 02:11.730
KOKONOE
RIN

02:08.980 --> 02:11.730
TO KOKONOE

02:08.980 --> 02:11.730
WHAT'S WRONG?
I'M WORRIED
HURRY BACK TO SCHOOL.

02:08.980 --> 02:11.730
A

02:09.510 --> 02:11.730
It'd be weird if I go ahead and send it.

02:12.730 --> 02:13.620
Better not.

02:13.610 --> 02:13.650
NEW EMAIL

02:13.610 --> 02:13.650
KOKONOE
RIN

02:13.610 --> 02:13.650
TO KOKONOE

02:14.230 --> 02:15.230
SENDING

02:34.610 --> 02:36.610
Aoki-sensei...

02:37.830 --> 02:38.760
Rin...

02:39.220 --> 02:40.490
I got you something.

02:41.230 --> 02:43.260
So, what do you want to ride?

02:43.720 --> 02:45.970
It'd be a waste if you don't, since we're here.

02:48.090 --> 02:51.410
Or would you rather go somewhere else?

02:51.410 --> 02:55.850
There's the aquarium, the zoo... we can go wherever you want.

02:57.050 --> 02:58.290
School...

02:58.290 --> 02:59.030
Huh?

02:59.030 --> 03:00.780
I want to go to school!

03:02.480 --> 03:04.450
I miss everybody.

03:04.450 --> 03:07.450
Everyone is worried and texting me.

03:07.450 --> 03:09.290
Kuro-chan, Mimi-chan...

03:09.630 --> 03:11.290
...and Aoki, huh?

03:13.500 --> 03:15.040
Give me your cell phone.

03:15.930 --> 03:20.430
Reiji, I told you a million times, Sensei didn't do anything wrong!

03:20.430 --> 03:22.550
That was just a coincidence-

03:21.450 --> 03:22.550
Give it to me.

03:33.510 --> 03:36.230
If you don't want to ride anything, then let's eat.

03:36.560 --> 03:39.250
There was a restaurant right over there.

03:39.250 --> 03:40.870
So what will you have, Rin?

03:52.500 --> 03:54.170
KOKONOE

03:58.460 --> 04:00.460
SEARCH RESULTS

03:58.460 --> 04:00.460
NO NEW MESSAGES

03:58.460 --> 04:00.460
RETURN

03:58.460 --> 04:00.460
EMAILS
MESSAGES
MESSAGES

04:03.210 --> 04:03.990
HAPPY BIRTHDAY AOKI-SENSEI!

04:03.220 --> 04:05.220
INBOX

04:03.220 --> 04:03.590
DRINKING

04:03.220 --> 04:03.590
TO DAISUKE

04:03.220 --> 04:05.220
THANKS

04:03.970 --> 04:05.220
HAPPY BIRTHDAY AOKI-SENSEI!

04:05.910 --> 04:09.220
I didn't erase it... and kept it for some reason.

04:13.150 --> 04:14.730
"I'll be here for you."

04:19.610 --> 04:23.510
I cannot... break my promise to her.

04:31.330 --> 04:33.040
TO KOKONOE

04:34.480 --> 04:36.730
Rin, you must be worn out.

04:36.730 --> 04:38.110
You can go ahead and-

04:39.520 --> 04:40.300
Rin!

04:45.260 --> 04:45.300
NEW SCHOOL LUNCH MENU TASTE-TESTING EVENT

04:47.600 --> 04:47.640
EVERYONE'S
WAITING

04:52.970 --> 04:54.440
Everyone is...

04:55.760 --> 04:59.730
Sensei is... waiting for me.

05:02.100 --> 05:04.450
Dad! Mom!

05:06.640 --> 05:09.520
What're you doing? Hurry and hit the books!

05:09.200 --> 05:10.210
<i>Why?!</i>

05:09.530 --> 05:11.200
You eat us out of house and home!

05:11.200 --> 05:13.870
<i>It's best to do what your father says.</i>

05:11.200 --> 05:12.540
Why?!

05:12.200 --> 05:13.660
<i>His parents died, yet he doesn't shed...</i>

05:12.540 --> 05:14.960
You can't hear <i>my</i> voice?

05:18.670 --> 05:19.960
Why?

05:21.170 --> 05:23.800
Can't my voice reach you?

05:25.900 --> 05:26.760
My...

05:41.760 --> 05:43.370
Why...

05:43.370 --> 05:44.450
was Rin...?

05:49.850 --> 05:53.030
Rin is adopting that attitude...

05:53.840 --> 05:57.550
because up until now, I've been
leaving her by her lonesome.

06:01.030 --> 06:02.210
That's right.

06:02.890 --> 06:06.510
I am the only one who can protect Rin.

06:07.410 --> 06:11.150
One of these days, Rin will understand that.

06:20.140 --> 06:21.970
Where do you think you're going?

06:25.070 --> 06:26.530
Now why...

06:26.940 --> 06:30.190
Why can't you understand?

06:31.620 --> 06:34.370
You're the one who doesn't understand!

06:34.490 --> 06:36.330
I'm doing all this to protect you!

06:37.690 --> 06:39.600
Protecting?

06:39.600 --> 06:42.370
Isn't that... a bit much?

07:06.820 --> 07:08.060
Reiji!

07:08.060 --> 07:10.320
Come on, open up! Reiji!

07:10.830 --> 07:13.450
I'm going to head out for a while.

07:13.450 --> 07:16.190
You be a good girl while I'm gone.

07:19.090 --> 07:20.630
Reiji...

07:33.240 --> 07:36.440
Why... Reiji?

07:50.370 --> 07:51.700
Mom...

07:52.910 --> 07:54.370
Reiji is...

08:00.040 --> 08:03.550
The lack of Rin-chan is tearing me apart!

08:04.270 --> 08:07.380
Kuro-chan... calm down...

08:09.320 --> 08:14.310
If I don't see Rin-chan soon,
I'll die from withdrawal.

08:14.310 --> 08:15.760
Hell, kill me now!

08:19.010 --> 08:22.530
Sensei must also be suffering from withdrawal.

08:24.210 --> 08:24.770
Huh?

08:35.140 --> 08:36.830
I still can't reach her.

08:37.710 --> 08:38.870
Why?

08:42.440 --> 08:43.960
Virgin!

08:44.530 --> 08:46.310
You're hiding something, aren't you?

08:46.310 --> 08:47.510
Eh?

08:47.510 --> 08:50.460
About what happened to Rin-chan.

08:50.910 --> 08:52.350
To Kokonoe?

08:53.780 --> 08:55.970
Wh... What do you mean?

08:57.890 --> 08:59.390
Not good.

08:59.390 --> 09:03.480
Kids, oddly enough, can pick up on these things.

09:04.950 --> 09:05.980
You see here...

09:06.390 --> 09:07.850
when people get the mumps-

09:07.850 --> 09:13.450
Just because you aren't able to see Rin-chan, you've been acting too damn wishy-washy!

09:13.450 --> 09:15.240
And um... you're a...

09:15.240 --> 09:18.500
Worthless, stinking pedophile!

09:18.500 --> 09:20.240
Er... huh?

09:23.640 --> 09:25.390
U-Usa?

09:25.390 --> 09:30.250
I told her that since you're a masochistic
virgin, you'd get pleasure from being abused.

09:31.890 --> 09:33.870
Give me a break.

09:33.870 --> 09:35.010
Still...

09:35.530 --> 09:39.260
I've also been feeling lonely without Rin-chan.

09:39.850 --> 09:45.020
B-But I should be telling myself that it's
good that Rin-chan got her mumps early.

09:45.020 --> 09:48.790
They say if you get mumps as an adult, you'd stop making sperm.

09:48.790 --> 09:52.020
Ah, but if we're talking about
Rin-chan... her uterus?

09:52.490 --> 09:55.750
Huh, I wonder if it kills off the uterus too?

09:55.750 --> 09:57.930
If we're talking about living things...

09:56.140 --> 10:00.510
<i>So it's not just Kokonoe, she was also worried about me.</i>

10:00.510 --> 10:05.540
A-Anyway, Rin-chan will be coming back soon, so...

10:08.620 --> 10:10.670
Wh... What are you doing?!

10:13.120 --> 10:14.050
Thanks a lot.

10:32.000 --> 10:36.370
That... That felt kinda good.

10:38.920 --> 10:40.970
I... I knew it!

10:40.970 --> 10:45.990
Kuro-chan is better at badmouthing than I am!

10:51.370 --> 10:53.000
Aoki-sensei!

10:57.300 --> 10:58.760
Kokonoe-san's...

11:02.440 --> 11:03.370
Eh?

11:07.970 --> 11:09.310
Are you serious?

11:09.310 --> 11:12.730
Yes. I plan to transfer her immediately.

11:13.200 --> 11:16.370
Parents can't decide to transfer
students whenever they feel like it-

11:16.370 --> 11:18.750
Who else except parents can decide?

11:20.040 --> 11:22.240
Did Kokonoe agree to this?

11:24.780 --> 11:25.740
Yes.

11:25.740 --> 11:27.060
That's not true.

11:27.060 --> 11:29.670
Kokonoe wouldn't agree to something like that.

11:30.500 --> 11:32.950
Kokonoe wants to come back to school.

11:33.880 --> 11:35.600
So for you to force her-

11:35.000 --> 11:36.880
What do you know about Rin?

11:37.630 --> 11:41.350
What could you, a damn
grownup, possibly know?!

11:42.530 --> 11:46.260
A grownup? You're an adult too, you know.

11:49.420 --> 11:53.700
A-Anyway, it's my duty to protect Rin.

11:53.700 --> 11:56.110
I will take care of the particulars!

12:01.170 --> 12:02.490
Um... excuse me...

12:06.870 --> 12:08.510
Shirai-sensei...

12:11.870 --> 12:13.870
This is Aoki-sensei's moment of truth.

12:18.380 --> 12:19.380
NOTES

12:18.380 --> 12:19.380
MOTHER PASSED AWAY, FATHER LIVING SEPARATELY
PRESENTLY IN CUSTODY OF RELATIVES

12:21.330 --> 12:24.450
I never noticed since we're
practically the same age...

12:24.450 --> 12:27.150
but he too is still just a child.

12:27.150 --> 12:29.810
What could you possibly know as a grownup!

12:35.040 --> 12:37.900
A grownup... huh?

12:39.310 --> 12:40.510
When exactly...

12:41.410 --> 12:43.990
did I become a grownup?

12:58.850 --> 12:59.670
Rin!

13:01.170 --> 13:04.010
You could have escaped out
the window if you wanted to.

13:04.870 --> 13:06.680
But you stayed put all this time.

13:07.970 --> 13:09.050
Oh, right.

13:09.050 --> 13:11.050
I went to your school.

13:11.670 --> 13:14.270
We discussed your transfer.

13:14.270 --> 13:15.940
Transfer?

13:15.940 --> 13:18.810
Why? Where's my say?!

13:22.850 --> 13:23.810
Rin...

13:25.740 --> 13:29.090
What are you... going to do with that?

13:33.150 --> 13:34.750
Let me...

13:35.150 --> 13:36.750
go back to school!

13:47.340 --> 13:48.630
This is...

13:50.170 --> 13:52.800
Hear me! Hear my voice!

13:54.230 --> 13:58.810
Why? Why isn't my voice reaching you?!

13:57.000 --> 13:58.810
<i>...isn't my voice reaching you?!</i>

13:59.150 --> 13:59.690
Rin!

14:04.440 --> 14:05.980
Hear me...

14:06.870 --> 14:08.530
Hear my voice!

14:23.320 --> 14:24.250
Kokonoe!

14:29.730 --> 14:32.640
Sen... sei...

14:41.960 --> 14:43.070
I see...

14:44.050 --> 14:45.530
That was it, huh?

14:46.810 --> 14:49.140
At some point I...

14:49.140 --> 14:52.210
...turned into the ones I hated.

15:05.910 --> 15:07.130
Aki...

15:07.880 --> 15:09.050
...san.

15:11.630 --> 15:12.670
Reiji.

15:13.610 --> 15:16.150
Protect Rin for me.

15:17.750 --> 15:19.010
That's...

15:19.840 --> 15:22.100
what I've been trying to do.

15:22.800 --> 15:24.510
But I can't.

15:25.610 --> 15:27.450
I guess I'm just...

15:28.420 --> 15:29.860
It's all right.

15:33.890 --> 15:36.350
You <i>will</i> protect Rin.

15:37.230 --> 15:42.370
And I'm sure Rin will also protect you.

15:59.120 --> 16:00.410
He'll be fine.

16:00.410 --> 16:02.130
He's just knocked out.

16:02.820 --> 16:03.670
Okay.

16:04.790 --> 16:07.870
I put Reiji into shock, didn't I?

16:11.150 --> 16:15.330
I... wounded Reiji.

16:16.910 --> 16:18.070
Kokonoe...

16:18.490 --> 16:23.450
Reiji... was already scarred from the beginning.

16:23.450 --> 16:26.000
But still, I...

16:28.520 --> 16:31.490
I... want to go back to school.

16:32.790 --> 16:33.880
But...

16:34.750 --> 16:38.490
I can't leave Reiji alone.

16:43.410 --> 16:44.610
I understand.

16:45.980 --> 16:49.090
Actually... I don't.

16:50.040 --> 16:52.110
I mean...

16:52.850 --> 16:55.360
I only go by what I've been through.

16:56.240 --> 16:57.990
Sensei?

16:58.690 --> 17:03.850
Well... I was raised in a normal home, went to a normal college...

17:04.960 --> 17:08.500
Truth be told, I'm just a boring, normal guy.

17:09.740 --> 17:13.100
That's why, not just you...

17:13.100 --> 17:18.170
Usa, Kagami, the whole class...

17:18.170 --> 17:22.270
I wasn't able to understand
you all, I'm sure of it.

17:22.970 --> 17:27.650
But, I really do want to understand, I don't want to give up.

17:28.830 --> 17:31.430
I want to understand his situation too.

17:32.310 --> 17:36.190
Aaagh, I'm not sure how to put this...

17:38.590 --> 17:41.030
You've taught me a lot, Kokonoe.

17:41.570 --> 17:43.390
Me?

17:44.330 --> 17:48.040
Yeah, about how I don't know a darn thing.

17:48.040 --> 17:54.300
But you also taught me that
it's never too late to learn.

17:55.070 --> 17:57.510
Aoki-sensei...

18:04.390 --> 18:08.100
Welp, it wouldn't be right if I
stayed too long or wake him up.

18:08.490 --> 18:10.370
I think I'll get going.

18:10.370 --> 18:12.830
Ah, I'll show you out.

18:26.870 --> 18:31.690
Be sure to call Kagami and Usa. They're worried about you.

18:31.690 --> 18:32.710
Okay.

18:32.710 --> 18:34.170
All right, I'll see you.

18:35.470 --> 18:36.590
Sensei.

18:37.460 --> 18:38.590
Hmm?

18:39.020 --> 18:40.510
Hug...

18:43.660 --> 18:44.850
Let's shake.

18:53.170 --> 18:55.120
Everyone's waiting for you.

18:55.120 --> 18:56.370
Uh-huh.

18:56.370 --> 18:58.960
I'll be waiting for you too.

18:58.960 --> 19:00.110
Okay.

19:13.450 --> 19:15.640
Hey, Sensei...

19:16.900 --> 19:22.650
Sensei is the first adult I believed in.

19:25.720 --> 19:31.400
And... Sensei believed in me too.

19:38.330 --> 19:40.850
Sensei... I love you.

19:44.550 --> 19:48.410
To play "so", you cover up these holes and blow...

19:50.990 --> 19:52.610
What was that?

19:52.610 --> 19:54.650
Are you some Indian snake charmer?

19:53.790 --> 19:56.170
You sure blow all right!

19:55.340 --> 19:56.170
Be quiet!

19:58.370 --> 20:01.850
I was never any good at soprano recorders.

20:01.850 --> 20:03.430
You got that right!

20:03.790 --> 20:07.810
You don't got a soprano, you're packing a super-sized alto, aren't ya?

20:08.240 --> 20:09.030
Kokonoe!

20:09.030 --> 20:10.680
No way!

20:11.110 --> 20:14.060
The virgin only has a flute at best!

20:14.530 --> 20:15.560
What the-

20:15.770 --> 20:18.070
You're being too loud, Aoki-sensei!

20:18.070 --> 20:20.400
I-I'm terribly sorry!

20:20.400 --> 20:25.160
Honestly! When will you ever conduct yourself as an actual teacher?

20:25.160 --> 20:30.450
Wow! It's <i>soo</i> cool how Shiro-
chan's whipping that virgin!

20:26.130 --> 20:27.130
Yeah...

20:27.130 --> 20:29.370
Don't "yeah" me!

20:29.370 --> 20:30.450
I apologize!

20:30.990 --> 20:33.370
Quit kowtowing in front of the students!

20:31.180 --> 20:36.030
She doesn't use any rough language, but she's still good at badmouthing.

20:34.310 --> 20:35.550
And don't make that sound!

20:35.550 --> 20:36.920
I'm sorry!

20:36.030 --> 20:36.920
Memo, memo!

20:52.920 --> 20:53.990
Aki-san.

20:59.790 --> 21:02.480
I can't win against Shirai-sensei.

21:02.480 --> 21:07.830
Oh, I'm sure she lashes out out of love.

21:08.330 --> 21:08.830
Hmm?

21:10.020 --> 21:11.240
Love?

21:11.240 --> 21:15.530
H-Has Shirai-sensei become an unexpected rival?

21:15.530 --> 21:18.040
No, that's simply not...

21:18.040 --> 21:22.730
But guys and girls with glasses
are unusually compatible...

21:22.730 --> 21:23.850
Houin-sensei?

21:34.560 --> 21:37.350
What- What are you doing there?!

21:38.170 --> 21:40.690
Thanks for everything, Sensei.

21:41.350 --> 21:42.440
Kokonoe?

21:41.550 --> 21:44.220
daisuki shiteru to

21:41.550 --> 21:44.220
Falling deeply in love

21:43.490 --> 21:45.110
Just when did you take my-

21:44.220 --> 21:47.730
mainichi harahara shichau kara

21:44.220 --> 21:47.730
makes a girl titillated every day.

21:45.110 --> 21:46.450
Wh-Why you...

21:47.730 --> 21:49.980
ureshii hazukashii

21:47.730 --> 21:49.980
I'm both a happy and

21:48.450 --> 21:51.450
I love making your
recorder moan!

21:49.980 --> 21:55.870
otomechikku shoshinsha desu

21:49.980 --> 21:55.870
a shy girly beginner.

21:51.790 --> 21:53.450
Are you dumb?

21:53.010 --> 21:56.920
isoide otomechikku shitai wa

21:53.010 --> 21:56.920
I want to hurry and do it like a girl.

21:55.250 --> 21:56.710
Indirect kiss!

21:56.920 --> 21:57.980
shitai wa

21:56.920 --> 21:57.980
Like a girl.

21:57.100 --> 21:59.250
Kokonoe...

21:59.980 --> 22:02.720
So you're too cool for indirect kisses?

22:02.720 --> 22:03.710
Okaay...

22:04.040 --> 22:06.220
Remember that one time?

22:05.130 --> 22:10.360
koi wa ikutsu kara hajimaru mono nan daro?

22:05.130 --> 22:10.360
When exactly do you start falling in love?

22:07.340 --> 22:10.470
What are you doing, Rin-chan?!

22:10.360 --> 22:15.080
yume miteta no tochi ga umitai yo jimi sugite

22:10.360 --> 22:15.080
I want my dreams to come true. It's too boring.

22:11.660 --> 22:13.390
See you, Aoki-sensei!

22:15.570 --> 22:19.410
I still have some ways to go as a teacher.

22:15.650 --> 22:20.380
motto ohana batake sanpo suru you na hibi

22:15.650 --> 22:20.380
The days should be more like strolls though flower fields.

22:19.410 --> 22:22.010
Not to mention being a stand-up adult.

22:20.380 --> 22:26.070
mousou mo souzou mo uragiraremashita

22:20.380 --> 22:26.070
But both my fantasies and imaginations were betrayed!

22:24.690 --> 22:27.010
Really, Rin-chan!

22:26.070 --> 22:30.830
hitori kami wo ijite

22:26.070 --> 22:30.830
I'm all alone twirling my hair

22:27.010 --> 22:29.890
Thank God you two didn't share a raw lip lock.

